    "text": "1 days ago Members of the Washington County Fair Association and Potosi Lions Club, the University Extension Council and 4H/FFA Clubs are working hard on the County Fairgrounds on Rt. 185 at the West edge of town in readiness for opening of the 78th Anniversary Annual Washington County Fair which is set for Wednesday, August 5th and continues nightly through Saturday, August 8th as always during the first full week of August. Read full article",
